{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo version of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estimated playtime: about 1 hour and 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unknown \u2013 Foggins is a mystery game blending puzzle, adventure, and point\u2011and\u2011click elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as the protagonist Vincent Marlowe, following an intriguing main story in search of hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with a variety of quirky NPCs and uncover their secret stories through dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807410/extras/\u1103\u1162\u1112\u116a.gif?t=1750134763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a rich, detailed environment using point\u2011and\u2011click gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover hidden narratives through conversations with distinctive NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deduce item uses and apply them intuitively via drag\u2011and\u2011drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fresh, creative puzzles within an immersive storyline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807410/extras/\u110b\u1161\u110b\u1175\u1110\u1166\u11b7\u1109\u1161\u110b\u116d\u11bc.gif?t=1750134763\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807410?t=1750134763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807410?t=1750134763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807410/8a82bd86cd209f5d18456b92c50bec4fce782204/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750134763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st